Hi everyone,

I am doing a bit of variable selection with some occupancy models. Until now I have been doing VS in the occupancy sub-model (on \psi). Its working well. Now I realize that i should probably do the same with the detection model (p).

Doing it I think should be straightforward. I am just wondering if anyone had any experience doing it and if anything funky happened as a result?

Thanks

Chris

